  "journal-of-radiation-research": "The Journal of Radiation Research is a fully open access Japanese journal from Oxford University Press covering radiation biology, physics and radiotherapy for radiation oncologists and medical physicists.",
  "journal-of-registry-management": "The Journal of Registry Management, from the US National Cancer Registrars Association, covers how cancer registries [databases of cancer cases] and health registries collect, manage and use their data.",
  "journal-of-surgical-oncology": "The Journal of Surgical Oncology, a long-running Wiley journal for cancer surgeons, covers operations, combined treatments and the laboratory science behind them, with themed Seminars issues.",
  "journal-of-the-egyptian-national-cancer-institute": "The Journal of the Egyptian National Cancer Institute in Cairo is an open access SpringerOpen journal with no publishing fee, focused on applied cancer research from developing countries.",
  "jnci-monographs": "JNCI Monographs, part of the Journal of the National Cancer Institute family from Oxford University Press, collects papers on one cancer topic or conference in each issue.",
  "klinicka-onkologie": "Klinická onkologie is the journal of the Czech and Slovak oncology societies, publishing clinical research, reviews and case reports in Czech, Slovak and English for central European oncologists.",
  "leukemia-and-lymphoma": "Leukemia & Lymphoma is a Taylor & Francis journal covering blood cancers for haematologists [blood doctors] and scientists, from leukaemia and lymphoma biology to new drugs and clinical outcomes.",
  "leukemia-research": "Leukemia Research, an Elsevier journal on leukaemia and related blood cancers, is the official journal of the Myelodysplastic Syndromes Foundation [a bone marrow disorder charity], read by haematologists and researchers.",
  "lung-cancer-journal": "Lung Cancer, an Elsevier journal, is the main specialist title for lung cancer and other chest tumours, publishing trials and reviews for thoracic [chest] oncologists, surgeons and lung doctors.",
  "magyar-onkologia": "Magyar Onkológia, the official journal of the Hungarian Society of Oncologists, publishes reviews, recommendations, original papers and case reports in Hungarian and English, plus congress abstracts.",
  "medical-oncology": "Medical Oncology is a broad Springer journal reporting clinical and preclinical [laboratory] research in cancer and blood disorders, with reviews and perspective pieces for medical oncologists and researchers.",
  "melanoma-research": "Melanoma Research, from Lippincott Williams & Wilkins, is devoted to melanoma [a skin cancer], from tumour genetics and immunology to case reports and studies of targeted and immune therapies.",
  "molecular-cancer": "Molecular Cancer is an open access BMC journal for laboratory cancer research, from tumour signalling and the tissue around tumours to biomarkers and new treatments.",
  "molecular-cancer-research": "Molecular Cancer Research, from the American Association for Cancer Research, publishes basic discoveries about how cancer cells work: cell cycle, DNA repair, gene regulation, oncogenes [cancer-driving genes] and signalling.",
